82	    /**
83	     * Formats an owner's initials as the upper-cased first letters of the first and last
84	     * names, dot-separated with a trailing dot (e.g. {@code 'J.S.'}), as required by the
85	     * API's read-only {@code initials} field.
86	     *
87	     * <p>{@code @Named} keeps this out of MapStruct's automatic method selection, so it is
88	     * applied only where referenced via {@code qualifiedByName}.
